OL,3,GNEWSACalls to end 'senseless violence' 
OL,4,Aas killer jailed                       
OL,6,FA woman has called for an end to       
OL,7,F"senseless violence" after her         
OL,8,Fbrother's killer was jailed for life.  
OL,10,FAt Bristol Crown Court earlier this    
OL,11,Fmonth, Mustafa Ali, 19, from Fishponds,
OL,12,Fwas found guilty of murdering          
OL,13,F47-year-old Leon Phillips on Stapleton 
OL,14,FRoad in Easton, Bristol in February.   
OL,16,FAli was given a life sentence earlier  
OL,17,Fat the same court and told he would    
OL,18,Fserve a minimum of 22-and-a-half years 
OL,19,Fbefore being eligible for parole.      
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
