OL,3,GNEWSACalls to end 'senseless violence' 
OL,4,Aas killer jailed                       
OL,6,FPhillips' eldest sister Maxine said:   
OL,7,F"It took seconds to commit but the     
OL,8,Fdevastating consequences will last with
OL,9,Fus forever."                           
